sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Shopper
    participant Web
    participant API
    participant DB@{ "type": "database" }
    Shopper->>+Web: Open cart
    Web->>+API: GET /cart
    loop Every item
        API->>DB: Price lookup
        DB-->>API: Price
    end
    API-->>-Web: Cart total
    alt Card accepted
        Web->>API: Pay
        Note over API,DB: Charge is idempotent
        API--)Web: Receipt
    else Card declined
        Web-xShopper: Payment failed
        Note right of Shopper: Try another card
    end
    Web-->>-Shopper: Done
